# Environment-specific configuration templates

## Development (.env.dev)
```bash
ENVIRONMENT=development
DATABASE_URL=sqlite:///./cybersurx.db
REDIS_URL=redis://localhost:6379/0
OLLAMA_API_KEY=dev-key
JWT_SECRET_KEY=dev-secret-change-in-production
ALLOWED_ORIGINS=http://localhost:3000
LOG_LEVEL=debug
```

## Staging (.env.staging)
```bash
ENVIRONMENT=staging
DATABASE_URL=postgresql://user:password@staging-db.internal:5432/cybersurx
REDIS_URL=redis://:password@staging-redis.internal:6379/0
OLLAMA_API_KEY={{STAGING_OLLAMA_KEY}}
JWT_SECRET_KEY={{STAGING_JWT_SECRET}}
ADMIN_EMAIL=admin@staging.cybersurx.io
ADMIN_DEFAULT_PASSWORD={{STAGING_ADMIN_PASSWORD}}
ALLOWED_ORIGINS=https://staging.cybersurx.io
LOG_LEVEL=info
SENTRY_DSN=https://xxxxx@sentry.io/project
```

## Production (.env.prod - NEVER COMMIT)
```bash
ENVIRONMENT=production
DATABASE_URL=postgresql://user:password@prod-db.internal:5432/cybersurx
REDIS_URL=redis://:password@prod-redis.internal:6379/0
REDIS_PASSWORD={{PROD_REDIS_PASSWORD}}
OLLAMA_API_KEY={{PROD_OLLAMA_KEY}}
JWT_SECRET_KEY={{PROD_JWT_SECRET}}
JWT_EXPIRE_MINUTES=480
ADMIN_EMAIL=admin@cybersurx.io
ADMIN_DEFAULT_PASSWORD={{PROD_ADMIN_PASSWORD}}
ALLOWED_ORIGINS=https://cybersurx.io
LOG_LEVEL=info
SENTRY_DSN=https://xxxxx@sentry.io/project
ZAP_API_KEY={{PROD_ZAP_KEY}}
LLM_MODEL=qwen3-coder:480b-cloud
LLM_API_BASE=https://ollama.com/api
```

## Notes

- Never commit `.env.prod` or `.env.staging` with real secrets
- Use GitHub Secrets for CI/CD
- Use AWS Secrets Manager or similar for production servers
- Update JWT_SECRET_KEY for each environment (minimum 32 random characters)
- Database passwords must be strong (min 16 chars, alphanumeric + special)
